    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-int-lab-eid-indication-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-eid-indication-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-int-lab-eid-indication-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version &#x1F4E6;0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-at-birth\">eid-indication-at-birth</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">EID at birth</td><td>Early infant diagnosis requested at birth.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-six-eight-weeks\">eid-indication-six-eight-weeks</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">EID at 6–8 weeks</td><td>Early infant diagnosis requested at six to eight weeks.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-two-twelve-months\">eid-indication-two-twelve-months</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">EID at 2–12 months</td><td>Early infant diagnosis requested between two and twelve months.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-repeat-invalid\">eid-indication-repeat-invalid</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Repeat because of invalid test</td><td>The EID test is repeated because a previous result was invalid.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-eid-indication-after-breastfeeding\">eid-indication-after-breastfeeding</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Repeat after cessation of breastfeeding</td><td>Repeat EID at least six weeks after the last exposure to breast milk.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
